COMMENT
SP19 ON stop/restart: run once straight through, then stop in 2019 and
restart; the restarted run and its .stop file must match across builds.
END

STDIDENT
ONRestart

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
FVSDataHardwood.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
End

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           8
THINBBA         2024        15
TREELIST           0

FMIN
SNAGSUM
POTFIRE
END

DATABASE
DSNOut
ONRestart.db
Summary
TreeLiDB           2
END

PROCESS
